# Root-context .dockerignore for api/Dockerfile (Docker Context Path = repo
# root — needed so db/migrations/ can be COPY'd into the API image). NOTE:
# api/.dockerignore does NOT apply to root-context builds (Docker only reads
# the context root's .dockerignore), so everything it guarded is re-guarded
# here. web/Dockerfile keeps its own web/ context and is unaffected.
.git
.github
web
docs
migration
scripts
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
api/src/**/*.test.ts
api/test-fixtures
api/test-setup.ts
api/vercel.json
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
*.md
**/*.md
deploy
